        <mxCell id="dit_moe-85" value="&lt;b&gt;Overview of the DiT-MoE architecture.&lt;/b&gt; Generally, DiT-MoE is built upon the DiT and composed of MoE-inserted Transformer blocks. In between, we replace the MLP with a sparsely activated mixture of MLPs. The right subfigure demonstrates the details of MoE layer integration of the shared expert strategy." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=21.3;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="dit_moe-figure">
